  "explanation": "Some → affirmative: There are some apples. I need some help.\nAny → questions & negatives: Are there any eggs? | There aren't any eggs.\n\nOffers/requests: Would you like some tea? | Can I have some water?\n\nWorks with plural countables and uncountables (some water, some books).",
